The remaining libstdc++ std::function layer: a converting constructor
constrained through __invoke_result, which routes the call-argument pack
through the variadic helper std::__invoke (modelled by invoke_fn here).
Deducing that variadic function template's pack from a two-or-more-argument
call in an unevaluated operand during constructor SFINAE is not yet performed,
so the construction fails ("found no match") and the proof passes vacuously.
Flip to CORE once that nested function-template pack deduction is implemented.
